# Medicheck Frontend Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values
# NOTE: All Firebase variables MUST have VITE_ prefix to be accessible in the browser

# ===========================================
# Firebase Configuration
# ===========================================
# Get these values from Firebase Console > Project Settings > Your Apps > Web App
# https://console.firebase.google.com/project/medicheck-19865/settings/general

